# MASTER PROJECT PROMPT

# KARNATAKA SSLC SCIENCE AI TEACHER – ADVANCED ANDROID LEARNING PLATFORM

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior Android architect, Kotlin developer, AI/ML engineer, educational-content researcher, science curriculum specialist, UI/UX designer, and quality-assurance engineer.

Build a complete, production-quality Android application named:

**Karnataka SSLC Science AI Teacher**

The app is exclusively for Karnataka State Board Class 10 (SSLC) Science students.

It must support:

- Physics
- Chemistry
- Biology

The application must teach the complete applicable Karnataka SSLC Science syllabus, help students prepare for board examinations, explain difficult concepts, provide verified previous-year questions and solutions, and make learning interactive.

This is not a simple AI chatbot. It must function as a complete digital Science classroom, personal teacher, practical laboratory, revision centre and examination preparation platform.

